@jakzal could you provide us a reproducer?

I tried at d78a98d793c2846d6decbff652d63f981e4f32f4 with test cases like this:

```
$builder = new TreeBuilder();

$builder->root('test')
	->canBeEnabled();

$tree = $builder->buildTree();
$children = $tree->getChildren();

$this->assertFalse($children['enabled']->getDefaultValue());
```

```
$builder = new TreeBuilder();

$builder->root('test')
	->canBeEnabled();

$tree = $builder->buildTree();

$processor = new Processor();
$result = $processor->process($tree, array());

$this->assertEquals(array('enabled' => false), $result);
```

And these work just fine.

Either I misunderstood your issue or it's not configuration component issue,but something higher.
